# Direct Gemini query-embedding probe matching current WFS code.
# Source commit: e84a2d786d900b7757b43a0bf61606ba249be442
# This goes to Google, NOT the WFS API. No Hearth secret is needed.
# No calls were executed while preparing this file.
#
# Set geminiApiKey privately in your REST Client environment.
# It must be the key for the SAME deployment you are diagnosing; never commit it.
# Use the deployment's effective EMBEDDING_MODEL_ID and EMBEDDING_DIMENSIONS.
# Values below are CODE DEFAULTS, not independently verified deployed settings.
# The code reads EMBEDDING_MODEL_ID, not GEMINI_MODEL_ID_EMBEDDING.
# API calls may consume provider quota or incur charges.
#
# GEMINI_ENDPOINT contributes ONLY scheme/host/port; its path is discarded.
# Default configured endpoint /v1beta/openai/ becomes /v1beta/models/...:embedContent.
# If a deployment overrides the origin, verify it before sending any key there.
@embeddingOrigin = https://generativelanguage.googleapis.com
@embeddingModel = gemini-embedding-2
@embeddingDimensions = 1536

# Exact input for typed "poultry" with no concepts is "poultry".
# The Poultry chip alone also embeds "poultry".
# Supper hard filter is NOT included in embedding text.
# Typed text + selected concepts are joined with a single space; query is trimmed,
# concepts are trimmed and case-insensitively deduplicated.
# No taskType, title, search_query prefix, lowercasing, or vector normalization
# is added by this query-embedding path.
#
# Inspect HTTP status, elapsed time, and embedding.values length.
# This intentionally lets the provider finish rather than imposing WFS's 300 ms
# shared budget, to distinguish slow success from provider rejection.
# It does not execute vector SQL or recipe hydration.
# A Mac measurement is your Mac's path to Google, not the Synology API's path.
# Successful 1536 output is necessary but does not prove good semantic matching.
# Do not share the key, full vector, or full request/response export.
#
# Source:
# https://github.com/AlexandreBrisebois/whats-for-supper/blob/e84a2d786d900b7757b43a0bf61606ba249be442/api/src/RecipeApi/Services/GeminiEmbeddingProvider.cs
# https://github.com/AlexandreBrisebois/whats-for-supper/blob/e84a2d786d900b7757b43a0bf61606ba249be442/api/src/RecipeApi/Services/RecipeSearchService.cs
# https://github.com/AlexandreBrisebois/whats-for-supper/blob/e84a2d786d900b7757b43a0bf61606ba249be442/api/src/RecipeApi/Program.cs

### Direct query embedding: poultry (provider request only)
POST {{embeddingOrigin}}/v1beta/models/{{embeddingModel}}:embedContent
x-goog-api-key: {{geminiApiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "model": "models/{{embeddingModel}}",
  "content": {
    "parts": [
      {
        "text": "poultry"
      }
    ]
  },
  "outputDimensionality": {{embeddingDimensions}}
}